 sound/soc/codecs/Makefile   |    2 +
 sound/soc/codecs/cod3035x.c | 3447 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 sound/soc/codecs/cod3035x.h | 1704 +++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 5162 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/codecs/cod3035x.c
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/codecs/cod3035x.h

